                    insight_mixed:          `A mixed transition: parts of the plan landed, but the diagnosis, the budget, the coalition work and the announcement didn't fully reinforce each other — enough seams for the activist to question whether the pathway is real and the dividend safe.`,
                    insight_overpromise:    `You over-promised public targets: a hard 50%-by-2030 commitment under technical uncertainty set up the credibility-and-greenwashing crisis when the capture pilot underperformed. The lesson is the line between a committed target and a framed ambition — cross it and a missed milestone becomes a scandal.`,
